BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
50. 711.8899999999999864 Td
(Mwancha Senior Community \(MSC\), founded in 2016 as Mwancha Home for the Elderly and legally) Tj
T* (registered under the Societies Act of Kenya, is dedicated to defending the dignity, health, and holistic) Tj
T* (wellbeing of vulnerable older persons in Kenya.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Through our Kebirigo community pavilion and network of 40 active ward-based volunteers across Nyamira) Tj
T* (and Kisii counties, MSC delivers compassionate home check-ins, medical escorts, emergency nutrition,) Tj
T* (and legal defense against elder abuse and property dispossession.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (For inquiries, partnerships, or academic citation permissions, please contact:) Tj
T* (Email: info@mwancha.org / mwanchahomeforelderly@gmail.com) Tj
T* (Headquarters: Kebirigo, Nyamira County, Kenya) Tj
T* (Website: https://mwancha.org) Tj
ET
